至17:30，在戛纳影节宫主舞台举行。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp71za2106tqslnzc09muj8y","originalUrl":"https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2055302191129473502","publishedAt":"2026-05-16T00:00:00.584Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-w6r54g","originalSourceName":"X：可灵 Kling AI (@Kling_ai)","family":"outlet-1n05q4z","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp71za2106tqslnzc09muj8y","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-w6r54g","name":"X：可灵 Kling AI (@Kling_ai)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"2026年戛纳电影节Kling AI大会将汇聚三位世界级电影制作人，展示他们运用Kling AI技术创作的标杆作品。中国动画导演魏立将分享AI生成动画《Born of the Tide》；Jon Erwin将解析为Amazon Prime制作的剧集《House of David》；Eekjun Yang则将介绍院线电影《RAPHAEL》的创作过程。三位讲者将深入探讨Kling AI在电影制作中的幕后应用，共同探索AI为影视创作带来的新可能性。活动定于2026年5月18日15:30至17:30，在戛纳影节宫主舞台举行。","reportEdition":"2026-05-16","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp7awlbb08wuslnzuw1nv0oq","title":"推理的一阶导数：AI浪潮下的增长逻辑","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-16T00:00:00.584Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp7awlbb08wuslnzuw1nv0oq","https://www.tomtunguz.com/first-derivative-of-inference"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp7awlbb08wuslnzuw1nv0oq","title":"推理的一阶导数：AI浪潮下的增长逻辑","originalTitle":"","summary":"AI推理是当今规模最大、增长最快的技术市场，预计七年内将达到2500亿美元。直接销售或转售推理服务的公司增长迅猛，如Anthropic和谷歌云。在AI时代前的软件公司中，Datadog和Twilio作为“推理的一阶导数”脱颖而出：Datadog的LLM可观测产品数据量近一季增长近两倍，其约20%的AI客户贡献了约80%的年度经常性收入；Twilio则通过AI重构的语音服务吸引客户。当前周期呈现高度集中特点，少数客户能驱动巨大收益。对于非AI原生公司，核心战略在于如何转售推理服务或从其客户的大量采购中获益。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp7awlbb08wuslnzuw1nv0oq","originalUrl":"https://www.tomtunguz.com/first-derivative-of-inference","publishedAt":"2026-05-16T00:00:00.584Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-uw5ga9","originalSourceName":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","family":"outlet-eygl44","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp7awlbb08wuslnzuw1nv0oq","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-uw5ga9","name":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"AI推理是当今规模最大、增长最快的技术市场，预计七年内将达到2500亿美元。直接销售或转售推理服务的公司增长迅猛，如Anthropic和谷歌云。在AI时代前的软件公司中，Datadog和Twilio作为“推理的一阶导数”脱颖而出：Datadog的LLM可观测产品数据量近一季增长近两倍，其约20%的AI客户贡献了约80%的年度经常性收入；Twilio则通过AI重构的语音服务吸引客户。当前周期呈现高度集中特点，少数客户能驱动巨大收益。对于非AI原生公司，核心战略在于如何转售推理服务或从其客户的大量采购中获益。","reportEdition":"2026-05-16","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp780kw8087mslnzyamm5l6a","title":"杨立昆访谈：剖析LLM局限，畅谈AI未来与创业新途","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-16T00:00:00.584Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp780kw8087mslnzyamm5l6a","https://x.com/ylecun/status/2055346714039464373"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp780kw8087mslnzyamm5l6a","title":"杨立昆访谈：剖析LLM局限，畅谈AI未来与创业新途","originalTitle":"","summary":"在Unsupervised Learning播客中，AI先驱杨立昆阐述了其对大型语言模型局限性的反主流观点，并探讨了机器人技术的发展路径。他解释了离开Meta的原因，以及与Geoff Hinton、Yoshua Bengio在图灵奖观点上的重大分歧。访谈还涵盖了他对2027年的预测、新公司AMI对世界模型的押注，并将OpenAI和Anthropic比作Sun Microsystems。此外，他建议博士生停止研究LLM，并分享了对AI安全、突破性研究发生机制以及Meta FAIR得失的尖锐见解。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp780kw8087mslnzyamm5l6a","originalUrl":"https://x.com/ylecun/status/2055346714039464373","publishedAt":"2026-05-16T00:00:00.584Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-5tfdmg","originalSourceName":"X：Yann LeCun (@ylecun)","family":"outlet-kwgvu3","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp780kw8087mslnzyamm5l6a","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-5tfdmg","name":"X：Yann LeCun (@ylecun)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T14:49:01.513Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"在Unsupervised Learning播客中，AI先驱杨立昆阐述了其对大型语言模型局限性的反主流观点，并探讨了机器人技术的发展路径。他解释了离开Meta的原因，以及与Geoff Hinton、Yoshua Bengio在图灵奖观点上的重大分歧。访谈还涵盖了他对2027年的预测、新公司AMI对世界模型的押注，并将OpenAI和Anthropic比作Sun Microsystems。此外，他建议博士生停止研究LLM，并分享了对AI安全、突破性研究发生机制以及Meta FAIR得失的尖锐见解。","reportEdition":"2026-05-16","reportKind":"daily"}],"total":14,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":13,"topics":[{"topic":"模型","count":3},{"topic":"应用","count":5},{"topic":"行业","count":4},{"topic":"开发","count":2}],"method":"AIHOT 提供选题、摘要与编排；模境保留来源与报告窗口，关联模型数据。原报道与模型评测分别核对，不将资讯排名当作能力评分。"}}
